	Well, the NCST 7.00 spoilers for nethack 3.0.10 can be found
on ftp.uu.net in the /usenet/comp.binary.games hierarchie.  Look
in the various index files for NH spoiler files.  90% of the stuff 
still applies to 3.1.0 (I have yet to compile 3.1.2, I've been away for
a while).  

	Also, a great source of information is from the sources themselves
(if you can read C code).  If you can't read code, then get them anyways
(which can be found in the same directory as well on uunet).  Un tar.Z them
and look in the dat directory and you will find all kinds of neto info.
Especially helpful are the true rumors file and the oracle file.  Plus
all the special levels are put into easy to read map files that can help
you get through the castle for instance.  Enjoy!

